            "review_text": "Merryheart\nSingapore, Singapore11100 contributions\n0\nExcellent fish cake noodles\nDec 2023 • Family\nA lady at the hotel recommended this no frill eating place frequented by the locals. The fish cakes adhere were really tasty & firm in texture. The soup noodles was a perfect blend of savoury from the fish & natural sour taste from tomatoes & tamarind. we added extra order of fish cakes as it really good. The best part was it was really cheap as they did not charge us tourist price unlike some noodles places in Hanoi & HCM city .\nWritten December 20, 2023",
