            "review_text": "Deja Vu\nBoston, Massachusetts1442 contributions\n0\nGood quick eat\nApr 2019 • Couples\nRecommended by the locals and they said that it’s one of the best and they are known for bun cha ca. Walked down the side street and it seems to be somewhat packed with customers , you can smell the aroma and see the broth along with all the meat and ingredients displaying by the front with the lady chef prepping up for customers. We ordered two special cha ca and it came out nice and hot . It looks so good and the table also provided all the sauce and fresh peppers. It’s worth a trip coming to This authentic spot if you are craving for bun cha ca.\nWritten April 25, 2019",
